// SINGULAR Ω v23.0 — Immortal Agent WORM Longevity & P-Core Verification Gate
§λ("verification")
§ω("singular.v23.verification")
§κ("CY-V23-LONGEVITY-GATE-001")

Ω ⟦ Ψ_0 : ⛨ℝ[88, 136], W_0 : ℝ[136, 136], K_0 : ℝ[88, 136], δ_0 : Δℝ[44], ξ_0 : ⚿[32] ⟧ {
  Ψ_1 ← φg(Ψ_0 ⋅ W_0)
